	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c28d4890797f96fc","x":-560,"y":-920,"width":920,"height":1120,"type":"text","text":"```\n╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                   CAPTAIN COMMAND — 10 BLOCKS (Interface Layer)                                ║\n║       Always-on. Routes, formats, logs. Never modifies signals or strategies.                  ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  B1 PG-30: SVC: command_server (FastAPI + WebSocket, systemd, always-on)                     │\n│  QUEUES: signal_queue(Redis List), command_queue(Redis List), notification_queue(Redis List)   │\n│  HEALTH: GET /health (monitored by UptimeRobot every 30s)                                     │\n│  MODULE: command_router.py. SECURITY: sanitise_for_api() → 6 fields only                     │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  B2 PG-31: SVC: command_server (WebSocket push to GUI clients)                               │\n│  READS: Redis (all shared state: regime_probs, aim_modifiers, combined_modifier)              │\n│         QuestDB (P3-D00, D01, D02, D08, D16, D22). Scoped by JWT user session.               │\n│  MODULE: gui_data_server.py. System Overview ADMIN-only module: admin_overview.py             │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  B3 PG-32: SVC: command_server (REST endpoints for broker adapters)                          │\n│  CONN: broker_adapter_topstep.py (mTLS), broker_adapter_ibkr.py (mTLS)                      │\n│  R/W: P3-D14(QuestDB: api_connection_states). Vault: per-user encrypted API keys              │\n│  MODULE: compliance_gate.py → verify signal within TSM constraints                           │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  B4 PG-33: SVC: command_server. R/W: P3-D08(QuestDB: tsm_configs). R: fee_schedule.json      │\n│  MODULE: tsm_manager.py → onboard_account(), validate_fee_schedule()                         │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  B5 PG-34: SVC: command_server (GUI workflow). MODULE: injection_flow.py                     │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  B6 PG-35: SVC: command_server (cron triggers per RPT schedule)                              │\n│  READS: P3-D02,D03,D04,D05,D06,D08,D11,D12,D13,D16,D19(QuestDB). signal_queue(Redis)        │\n│  WRITES: P3-D09(QuestDB: report_archive). MODULE: report_generator.py                        │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  B7 PG-36: SVC: command_server + Telegram bot (python-telegram-bot, long-polling)            │\n│  CONN: Telegram Bot API (HTTPS). WRITES: P3-D10(QuestDB: notification_log)                   │\n│  MODULE: notification_router.py, telegram_bot.py. Rate limit: 60/hr per user                 │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  B8 PG-39: SVC: command_server (cron 19:00 EST daily)                                        │\n│  READS: broker API (balance, fills). R/W: P3-D08(QuestDB). W: P3-D23(QuestDB: zeroed).       │\n│  W: P3-D19(QuestDB: reconciliation_log). MODULE: reconciliation.py, payout_rules.py           │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  B9 PG-40: SVC: command_server. W: P3-D21(QuestDB: incident_log).                           │\n│  PUB: Redis notification_queue. MODULE: incident_handler.py                                  │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  B10 PG-41: SVC: online_engine + command_server (continuous validation)                      │\n│  READS: P3-D00.data_sources(QuestDB). MODULE: data_validator.py                              │\n│  Creates incidents via PG-40 on freshness/completeness/schema failures                       │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nINFRASTRUCTURE: command_server = FastAPI + WebSocket (systemd, always-on).\n  Queues: Redis Lists (signal, command, notification). Storage: QuestDB (all P3-D*).\n  External: Telegram Bot API (HTTPS), broker adapters (mTLS), UptimeRobot (health).\n  Auth: JWT per-user sessions (24h expiry, silent refresh). Vault: encrypted API keys.\n```\n"}
